  "title": "Classifying controls — Varga Medical",
  "minutes": 15,
  "skill": "application",
  "instructions": "Classify each control at **Varga Medical**.",
  "exhibits": [
    {
      "title": "Controls",
      "content": "1. Program changes are tested in a separate environment and approved before release.\n2. The billing system rejects invoices for customers not in the master file.\n3. The audit committee meets quarterly with internal audit without management present.\n4. User access is reviewed quarterly and terminated employees' access is removed.\n5. The system matches purchase orders, receiving reports and invoices before payment.\n6. Monthly, the controller reviews a report of manual journal entries over $50,000."
    }
  ],
  "parts": [
